{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream-Chasing Window Cleaner x Action-Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a thrilling action-packed adventure as a window cleaner navigating the towering skyscrapers of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase your dreams, face harsh realities, and carve out Sky\u2019s future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Five Distinct Scenarios</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features five different scenarios depicting key moments in Sky\u2019s life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scenario has its own characters, setting, and circumstances, leading to completely different stories.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Departure</strong> \u2013 A runaway youth moves to the city, growing up while torn by family ties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Resort</strong> \u2013 A tropical coming-of-age story where encounters shape one\u2019s future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bad Fortune</strong> \u2013 Driven by debt, a young man falls into the criminal underworld.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>White Prison</strong> \u2013 Workers face extreme cold and harsh labor, bound together by solidarity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Urban Dream</strong> \u2013 Among dreamers in the city, a tale of ambition, success, and failure unfolds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrilling Cleaning Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize wires and skills to swiftly and precisely clean buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014one slip could lead to a deadly fall. Overcome hazards like birds, lightning strikes, strong winds, and many many more as you aim for top performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.poster.avif?t=1772163202\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.webm?t=1772163202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.mp4?t=1772163202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Money and Well-being</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taxes, rent, medical bills\u2014survive day by day while managing your limited income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overworking takes a toll on your body. Rest and entertainment are key to maintaining balance in your daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.poster.avif?t=1772163202\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.webm?t=1772163202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.mp4?t=1772163202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Skills &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your cleaning tools and unlock abilities through the Skill Synapse skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the optimal setup and clean more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.poster.avif?t=1772163202\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.webm?t=1772163202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.mp4?t=1772163202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Life That Deepens with Every Playthrough</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ach scenario has multiple possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices, skill builds, and approach to money management can dramatically change how the story plays out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the more Sky\u2019s life expands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014If you reach for the sky, one day you\u2019ll touch it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Sky\u2019s future with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/65e2f4cacc8dc823f97a23175da861ae.avif?t=1772163202\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/ba503671c3b2df3cdb3386b2c01ebe540be1b97f.jpg"},{"name":"Work in Progress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/ba503671c3b2df3cdb3386b2c01ebe540be1b97f.jpg"},{"name":"A Summer's Memory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/ba503671c3b2df3cdb3386b2c01ebe540be1b97f.jpg"},{"name":"The Underworld","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/ba503671c3b2df3cdb3386b2c01ebe540be1b97f.jpg"},{"name":"Awakened Harmony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387430/ba503671c3b2df3cdb33